    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "makes sense. but wouldn't a huge argument against that be that highways are actually more critical for people in the suburbs or rural areas who can't walk to a train station? feels like cutting road funding might really hurt those communities more than it helps the city center.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
